# 14. Essential Commands

## Build an Image

```bash
podman build -t IMAGE_NAME .
```

or

```bash
podman build -t IMAGE_NAME -f MY_CONTAINERFILE .
```

---

## List Images

```bash
podman images
```

or

```bash
podman image list
```

---

## Run a Container

```bash
podman run -d \
--name CONTAINER_NAME \
-v HOST_DIR:CONTAINER_DIR:Z \
IMAGE_NAME
```

---

## List Running Containers

```bash
podman ps
```

---

## List All Containers

```bash
podman ps -a
```

---

## Generate systemd Service

```bash
podman generate systemd \
--name CONTAINER_NAME \
--files
```

---

## Reload User Systemd

```bash
systemctl --user daemon-reload
```

---

## Enable Container Service

```bash
systemctl --user enable --now container-CONTAINER_NAME.service
```

---

## Enable Linger

```bash
loginctl enable-linger USERNAME
```

---

## Verify Service

```bash
systemctl --user status container-CONTAINER_NAME.service
```

