# 15. Final Takeaway

Don't memorize dozens of EX200 container questions.

Instead, memorize **one universal workflow**.

```text
             Containerfile
                    │
                    ▼
          Build the Image
                    │
                    ▼
          Run the Container
                    │
                    ▼
      Generate systemd Service
                    │
                    ▼
      Enable the Service
                    │
                    ▼
      Enable User Linger
                    │
                    ▼
      Verify Everything
```

Whenever you encounter a new EX200 Podman question, only these values change:

- 📦 Image Name
- 📦 Container Name
- 👤 Username
- 📁 Host Directory
- 📂 Container Directory
- ⚙️ Service Name

The **workflow stays exactly the same.**

